# Test kernel: the constants inf and nan, as operands of a comparison, a select, a product and a
# sum, each visible as an output limb. They have no meaning in the real model, so this kernel is of
# the extended domain and has no real-model statement (it claims represents).
kernel:   ops_special
input:    a
output:   x = x0 x1 x2
value:    a
ensures:  represents x
status:   unverified
domain:   extended
ieee_status: unverified
cone_exempt: a test of the constants, not of a computation

m  = lt(a, const inf)
x0 = select(m, a, const nan)
p  = prod(a, const inf)
x1 = select(m, p, const inf)
x2 = add(a, const nan)
